    "description": "The Telecom SIM Deactivation API enables businesses to deactivate multiple telecom SIM cards efficiently in a single operation. This API is essential for service providers looking to manage SIM inventory and ensure optimized lifecycle management. Typical consumers include telecom operators who handle large batches of SIM deactivations due to service changes or customer requests. By facilitating bulk operations, this API helps streamline workflows and improve operational efficiency in telecom service management.",
